<body>
    <h1>Automated Test Scripts in Playwright</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"7d3a4bcd-2af4-4dc8-9823-e4a9a8eefa4e">Automated test=
 scripts have been built in Playwright to test each story. Below is a list =
of all test scripts built to date with a link to the <a class=3D"external-l=
ink" href=3D"https://dev.azure.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%20CRM%20Integrat=
ion/_git/WRB%20-%20Power%20Platform?path=3D/PlaywrightTests" rel=3D"nofollo=
w">Azure DevOps repo</a> where the code is stored.</p>
<p local-id=3D"1be3c59c1f65"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://ber=
kleycloud.sharepoint.com/sites/bts-marketingautomationteam-Argano/_layouts/=
15/stream.aspx?id=3D%2Fsites%2Fbts%2Dmarketingautomationteam%2DArgano%2FSha=
red%20Documents%2FArgano%2FRecordings%20%26%20Transcripts%2FBerkley%20%2D%2=
0Automation%20Test%20Scripts%20Knowledge%20Transfer%20%20%2D%20Session%201%=
2D20260306%5F090335%2DMeeting%20Recording%2Emp4&amp;ga=3D1" rel=3D"nofollow=
">Berkley - Automation Test Scripts Knowledge Transfer - Session 1-20260306=
_090335</a></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"af49afb89d5b" id=3D"AutomatedTestScriptsinPlaywright-AllAut=
omatedTestScriptsbuilttodate:">All Automated Test Scripts built to date:</h=
3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1178" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"ff=
817d62-920c-47a9-9300-e9a0c19ba459" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 140.0px;">
