<p local-id=3D"dceb1a9b3236">Account</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e3c35048a2b2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f7ed0861a8e5">Account Form - Account Types field</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0cf4af07ecdf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5f020c957900">11807</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3c4064900a70" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"353c0b7b950f">Checks if =E2=80=9CAgency=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=
=9COffice=E2=80=9D are options in =E2=80=9CAccount Type=E2=80=9D field.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"a79547d813a9">
<td data-local-id=3D"e167c5eb2084" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"36f9052450a3">Account Form - State field</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"affdc25e9426" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62a305d93857">11808</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ac905b813a1e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"dfafa1f5dec2">Checks if =E2=80=9CState=E2=80=9D field has th=
e =E2=80=9C*=E2=80=9D symbol in both the Quick Create Form and the Main For=
m.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bc44305f747f">
<td data-local-id=3D"8a8762af1b6e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62d2ba714145">Account Hierarchy - Assign child-father accoun=
t relations</p>
</td>
<td rowspan=3D"2" data-local-id=3D"8dc995af9bbe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5339e517d049">11929</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1a3ef2512d3c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f9a5c41dab4c">Creates 2 accounts and assign one as parent of=
 the other.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"51ad310e50e8">
<td data-local-id=3D"034be7039bd7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1db03a3b05b7">Account Hierarchy - Clean data</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"42416aaa3382" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c53d420e916">Removes the 2 accounts created.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d2fe9fb3d603">
<td data-local-id=3D"dc696120f9f1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43c3a5dc95c5">Account - Search record by NPN</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4a7cf40170a4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db881cc05489">12982</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"8902343a3066" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9c9075c486bf">Searches for =E2=80=9CPlaywright Test Reserved=
=E2=80=9D account on the search box based on the NPN value =E2=80=9C0005432=
1=E2=80=9D.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"116a7032ed30">
<td data-local-id=3D"3b04c9703778" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"911538dbf7ed">Account - Contact role assignment</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b5887348b539" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9aa3dc5407a5">13190</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1c5b5a4bf350" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fd350bda30b1">Creates and removes a new Contact Role (=E2=80=
=9CCarrier Relations=E2=80=9D) for =E2=80=9CPlaywright Test Reserved=E2=80=
=9D account.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"f97010cf2483">
<td data-local-id=3D"828bb301a160" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc65bb733f15">Account - Account Extension view fields</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d0518aeeb9f7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4ba5ba5b9202">13270</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f9745240fc43" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"968d28ebd808">Creates an account, fills its =E2=80=9CAccount=
 Extension=E2=80=9D fields and checks if the data is correctly shown on the=
 view. The account is later removed.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4208e6c4d2c8">
<td rowspan=3D"3" data-local-id=3D"c7af9a7c1040" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8ef3f96fa63d">Agency Visit</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b0730ad9923f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f231e976f01">Agency Visits - Notes linked to OU-Specific re=
cord</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"15332ac540d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b49c1c592f8a">13016</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5466f271e134" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9d7f6e9abdc5">Creates an Agency Visit, links it with =E2=80=
=9CPlaywright Test Reserved=E2=80=9D account, adds notes and deactivates th=
e Agency Visit, and after 20 seconds it checks if the notes were added to t=
he account. The notes are cleared and the agency visit removed.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6c67a4a1f110">
<td data-local-id=3D"3e51bed2013b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"99ef80aa1f0c">Agency Visits - CRUD Operations</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c322e0906f62" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"908594e7086a">13192</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"043a1d0c3062" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f10d7cbda0d4">Creates a new agency visit and edits its field=
s, checks for =E2=80=9CDeactivate=E2=80=9D options and removes the record.<=
/p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9c2b2ce8093f">
<td data-local-id=3D"5b5015209546" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55ddb1687a38">Agency Visits - Testing feedback from Demo 1</=
p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"607a9a14f223" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"877c5a3e9632">13633</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"197d88415cd2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ebee8b2d27eb">After creating an agency visit, it checks for =
different options for =E2=80=9CDuration=E2=80=9D, checks if the contact is =
set as =E2=80=9CRequired Attendee=E2=80=9D in a new meeting and checks if t=
he contact appears in the =E2=80=9CTo=E2=80=9D field when creating a new em=
ail. The record is then removed.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"632e19a420df">
<td data-local-id=3D"f9b03628c915" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d8d9361b7dc8">Announcement</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"446da9255e39" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3cb6e2ccb8eb">Announcements Form - CRUD operations</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"759faf486061" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ac18b1b661bf">11807</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"93de13dbbfdf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1f400c5d015e">Creates, searches, deactivate and removes an a=
nnouncement.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"95ab84cfd1a7">
<td rowspan=3D"5" data-local-id=3D"0ecea1ab5438" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e265f7c58e04">Contact</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0765aa80c207" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"776abcd7f1d9">Contact Extension - Check fields</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4708cf579117" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0252c851b134">12940</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f835f94fc76c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a2c67ce1ff5">Checks if the contact extension of =E2=80=9CPl=
aywright Test Extension=E2=80=9D contact have editable fields and the optio=
ns for Focus are =E2=80=9CLarge Business=E2=80=9D, =E2=80=9CMiddle Market=
=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9CSmall Business=E2=80=9D.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7d99962321d6">
<td data-local-id=3D"65d476660503" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"267e83a2b46c">Contact Search - Name, Email or NPN</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1e1b6fcc445b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"766e74bca57b">10381</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"daed97a3917e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"fc490f774557">Checks if =E2=80=9CPlaywright Search NPN=E2=80=
=9D contact can be found through the search box with the name, the email (<=
a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"mailto:playwright@test.com" rel=3D"nofoll=
ow">playwright@test.com</a>) and NPN (1234).</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"77e9e078e770">
<td data-local-id=3D"e37841a55081" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cf2e79e17bf9">Contact - Business Card Scanner</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f05b02e6a4dd" class=3D"confluenceTd">
