</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d676139adee8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3c29bf8eefa3">Checks how the required field changes on the Q=
uick Create Form of contact depending on the filled data between =E2=80=9CE=
mail=E2=80=9D, =E2=80=9CBusiness Phone=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=9CMobile Phone=
=E2=80=9D.</p>
