<p local-id=3D"3e58551fef58">12971</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"467b21471e93" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3288f5f5bb8d">Creates a new contract, assigns and checks if =
contact information is shown correctly in the view=E2=80=99s form, deactiva=
tes and deletes the record.</p>
</td>
