</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0231660e0a40" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"62e9b287d2b8">Tests stored business cards with the business =
card scanner to check if the data is correctly extracted from them.</p>
</td>
</tr>
