<h2 local-id=3D"ac40a5ad-b693-4351-98e7-40b0b132cc7c" id=3D"AutomatedTestSc=
riptsinPlaywright-TestDataCurrentlyBeingUsedintheTESTEnvironment">Test Data=
 Currently Being Used in the TEST Environment</h2>
<p local-id=3D"525abea6-d5ed-469e-aec7-43ef6c0730d2">The following records =
are being used for automated tests run in the TEST environment. These recor=
ds should not be modified or removed from this environment:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9930acf9-2171-4da3-82f5-b3efe041c2dd">
<li local-id=3D"dff15f8b-8d06-4c5b-8aeb-b6d33c107473">
<p local-id=3D"42bd6cde-eb5a-4ccc-b27d-174cff487389">Sales Territories &gt;=
 Territory Team Members</p>
<ul local-id=3D"bb430475-8e8a-4d90-9cfb-736dd650bb34">
<li local-id=3D"4fdd8f29-4257-4aca-a057-eb3a8a551922">
<p local-id=3D"865b5bd3-464e-41a6-853e-8962263a2d19">Central</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"306186b9-7aa6-472d-a3d7-9d1dac5ca0f5">
<p local-id=3D"22517107-d1b9-48b3-90dc-229fe0613d42">South</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"95a80599fd7a">
<p local-id=3D"87cefae23b8c">CO</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"7d2179e6eec0">
<p local-id=3D"5a33f155f0c7">AR</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"445077a8-d26a-4a47-9368-203ad43181be">
<p local-id=3D"bc6d3311-716f-4950-a2b5-1c77fc8f88f2">Business Units</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a5e2e232-76e0-4653-8e04-4f4c81f1044a">
<li local-id=3D"445077a8-d26a-4a47-9368-203ad43181be">
<p local-id=3D"854ff618-9900-43f4-86eb-c18e4cb52e3e">Berkley Aspire</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"64cb38bb-4e11-4304-a303-e850464a97d7">
<p local-id=3D"98b15257-c1ab-4d30-99d7-d03dae5c273d">Every record that star=
ts with =E2=80=9CPlaywright=E2=80=9D (Accounts, Contacts, Producer Codes, L=
eads, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"7a89b2d1-a52f-40c0-b295-c90d76e46f4f" id=3D"AutomatedTestSc=
riptsinPlaywright-HowtoRunAutomatedTestScriptsinPlaywright">How to Run Auto=
mated Test Scripts in Playwright</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d3315905-e267-42e7-9607-a28ca4bb397d">The steps below detail=
 the process for running automated test scripts in Playwright.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"49c36203-7993-4c37-a92b-475ff5162538">
<li local-id=3D"d54d09b9-de40-46a3-b85c-1f223bb907fc">
<p local-id=3D"7ff9466a-83e0-4a42-b0d3-f9b7242bc01a">Install Node.js</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"27a359db-0a79-4c6d-b417-b56e5e19cd66">
<p local-id=3D"fa00c0e4-2e00-4537-8c8f-47c84788f886">Set Execution Policy i=
n Powershell : <em>Set-ExecutionPolicy -ExecutionPolicy RemoteSigned -Scope=
 CurrentUser</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cdfdb040-005c-4ca6-9559-30f62f584918">We=E2=80=99ll need to =
create a new local project on VS Code, and install the following 2 extensio=
ns:</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20251219-200445.png" width=3D"339" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"d266739e8df32de9f928f65d4bb32437868db86640c7b91d8f0e15e901cc6991" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1338=
802211/image-20251219-200445.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1766174=
686536&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"159" data-width=3D=
"339" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"146925=
1861" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20251219-200445.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1338802211" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"32" data-media-id=3D"83f6c6e9-b8b7=
-413b-a1ec-106c67ebc6f3" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"158"></span>
<ul local-id=3D"6d84cb00-840d-414e-9ebe-1d87521432a3">
<li local-id=3D"0d4e0a82-d5f0-44f1-804a-64690065309a">
<p local-id=3D"e0fd1cec-08ab-449c-b7f8-5007f42543a7">=E2=80=9CNPM-Scripts=
=E2=80=9D allow us to execute the commands necessary to use node.js for Pla=
ywright.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"37c82b79-2893-4793-9103-da8f8a9e4561">
<p local-id=3D"ec7911f3-a0d4-46ba-8e16-1ddd9699dba9">=E2=80=9CPlaywright Te=
st for VSCode=E2=80=9D adds a new tab on the side-bar called =E2=80=9CTesti=
ng=E2=80=9D, that will display the recognized tests and some extra tools fo=
r developing.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3be7fcd5-86b6-4115-bf1e-92491accec96">After that, on the VS =
Code console we=E2=80=99ll write the following commands:</p>
<p local-id=3D"f3a98237-ffa7-4ead-bfd8-35a37c78259e"><em>Set-ExecutionPolic=
y -Scope Process -ExecutionPolicy Bypass</em></p>
<p local-id=3D"ace61fed-a367-4441-97e9-81ce360b3f4c">This command allows us=
 to execute node.js commands required to install Playwright without admin p=
ermissions.</p>
<p local-id=3D"dd288e0b-f4c1-44ee-9080-f00c2299c2bd">To install Playwright,=
 we have 2 options:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"901bfab3-def6-487e-ace7-ee4d0b468ce5">
<li local-id=3D"acb08913-9d0c-4a6f-b19e-738078a5ac8d">
<p local-id=3D"03a7cf3e-1db3-4c09-98f4-f4d59acab816">Write on the VS Code c=
onsole the following scripts:
<br>
<em>npx playwright install </em>
<br>
<em>npx playwright install-deps</em></p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"522f81dd-fc5e-42de-9daf-710950deec6a">
<p local-id=3D"2c62579e-ad81-4c2a-93f0-4c924eec12d3">Write on the top field=
 =E2=80=9C&gt;install=E2=80=9D and select =E2=80=9CTest: Install Playwright=
=E2=80=9D</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"Capture.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"043ef216a55=
440137559de1371abeb9652b290f366a0e90579f0bc714734f64b" data-image-src=3D"ht=
tps://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1338802211/Capture.=
png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1766175680731&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&a=
mp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"68" data-width=3D"533" data-unresolved-comment-=
count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1470038230" data-linked-resource-ver=
sion=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-de=
fault-alias=3D"Capture.png" data-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"1338802211" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"32"=
 data-media-id=3D"1eb09fac-877e-4531-934a-28f73e75a61f" data-media-type=3D"=
file" height=3D"59"></span>
<p local-id=3D"d450f95b-cba6-44c9-ba87-67a92226717c">It=E2=80=99s not neces=
sary to change the default configurations.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"700f8b29-a8ca-4cf3-849a-efec63c3cce3"><strong><span style=3D=
"background-color: rgb(223,216,253);">Once we have Playwright installed on =
the project, we cannot change the project location. Otherwise, it won=E2=80=
=99t execute again.</span></strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"3ea7d004-3fc9-4913-bf1a-6f1c78384603">On the <a class=3D"ext=
ernal-link" href=3D"https://dev.azure.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%20CRM%20I=
ntegration/_git/WRB%20-%20Power%20Platform" rel=3D"nofollow">Berkley Reposi=
tory</a>, we can find a <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://dev.azur=
e.com/WRB-CRMIntegration/WRB-%20CRM%20Integration/_git/WRB%20-%20Power%20Pl=
atform?path=3D/PlaywrightTests" rel=3D"nofollow">folder</a> containing data=
 for the local project. Download the repo and insert and replace the files =
and folders with the ones from the repo.</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20251219-202940.png" width=3D"298" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"47ef823a5c5091a3e7c3bc648427e4e7e499279b08a56c038772f11840dcc820" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1338=
802211/image-20251219-202940.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1766176=
181104&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"353" data-width=3D=
"298" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"146944=
8427" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20251219-202940.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1338802211" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"32" data-media-id=3D"ffb797d3-8a64=
-4890-8a3c-10355af3fe88" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"353"></span>
<p local-id=3D"ecdc0ae5-cfbe-4f20-a061-3cf1ceb4b5c9"><span class=3D"conflue=
nce-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-s=
ize"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-center" alt=3D"image-202=
51219-203124.png" width=3D"277" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"1a330e0a36e35bc9de7=
fcc878a73278f35ad733b3de20a372abee9a95b6c5962" data-image-src=3D"https://wr=
berkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1338802211/image-20251219-2=
03124.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1766176285728&amp;cacheVersion=
=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"295" data-width=3D"277" data-unresolved-c=
omment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"1469481191" data-linked-resou=
rce-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-reso=
urce-default-alias=3D"image-20251219-203124.png" data-base-url=3D"https://w=
rberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png=
" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1338802211" data-linked-resource-con=
tainer-version=3D"32" data-media-id=3D"915b2b04-0bcb-41fb-b43a-cab476787be0=
" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"294"></span></p>
<p local-id=3D"fdcd3672-5c73-4eb9-8399-855378555530">Now, using the =E2=80=
=9CTesting=E2=80=9D tab, the tests should be recognizable, and we can click=
 on =E2=80=9CPlay=E2=80=9D over every test on the list to let it execute:</=
p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20251219-203427.png" width=3D"390" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"bc11cc5a6a3bb8c09e0917cc3d5b02adfeefa7c5ea8205e1f5a496c202ef7554" data-=
