e-46d3-b328-54ac119d3f42" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"152"></span>
<p local-id=3D"30dd1652-6bbb-4971-8a43-7bf7a07f2457"><span style=3D"backgro=
und-color: rgb(223,216,253);">NOTE: Dynamics 365 is very sensitive to scree=
n sizes, changing a lot the distribution of buttons, sections and other stu=
ff based on that. It=E2=80=99s important to make these tests in a fixed res=
olution of 1080x1920 or bigger. If the screen is not big enough, a negative=
 zoom can work as well. The idea is usually to have a size that can show 3 =
columns of fields in a form.</span></p>
<p local-id=3D"76efd9afe599">To make sure the resolution is always the same=
 during executions, despite the screen or window size, on the file =E2=80=
=9Cplaywright.config.ts=E2=80=9D you can find a section dedicated to pre-se=
t the resolution:</p>
<span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper conflu=
ence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image image-ce=
nter" alt=3D"image-20260304-150055.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"af2ce2fead4ccd50c84723eff9aa7dd91289867d1895294b6eedafd466934ec7" data-=
image-src=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/1338=
802211/image-20260304-150055.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1772636=
457735&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"242" data-width=3D=
"546" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"175099=
0855" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attac=
hment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-20260304-150055.png" dat=
a-base-url=3D"https://wrberkley.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-co=
ntent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"1338802211" d=
ata-linked-resource-container-version=3D"32" data-media-id=3D"ad62074c-c9c4=
-494b-a7fb-0bc48b980618" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"207"></span>
<h2 local-id=3D"fc1eda86938c" id=3D"AutomatedTestScriptsinPlaywright-Errorh=
andling">Error handling</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d9b734ae3a12">Due to the sensitivity of playwright tests and=
 the inconsistency on loading speed of some elements of the CRM, there=E2=
=80=99s always a possibility that an error occurs in the middle of a test e=
xecution. To avoid further errors, it=E2=80=99s important to remove the dat=
a created on those tests manually before re-starting.</p>
<p local-id=3D"06a4b9c4dff3">This is a list of things to do in case a test =
fails before re-starting it:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"02bb0ca34498">
<li local-id=3D"139274a33cac">
<p local-id=3D"5b09a0f06682"><u>Account Hierarchy - Assign child-father acc=
ount relations</u>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a4324439493f">
<li local-id=3D"08b736310b7d">
<p local-id=3D"65bc39278a27">Remove the <strong>Account </strong>=E2=80=9C<=
em>Hierarchy Test Father Playwright</em>=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b19d349d2b07">
<p local-id=3D"5067ff3f4839">Remove the <strong>Account </strong>=E2=80=9C<=
em>Hierarchy Test Child Playwright</em>=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"4faea2f39b77">
<p local-id=3D"18b6501faf81"><u>Account Hierarchy - Clean data</u>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1154f015e87d">
<li local-id=3D"62285bf438b8">
<p local-id=3D"206e8ad6d48e">Remove the <strong>Account </strong>=E2=80=9C<=
em>Hierarchy Test Father Playwright</em>=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"51e201a18b8c">
<p local-id=3D"1cedb060b6c1">Remove the <strong>Account </strong>=E2=80=9C<=
em>Hierarchy Test Child Playwright</em>=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"ead908c43cee">
<p local-id=3D"dd46327859da">Re-execute <u>Account Hierarchy - Assign child=
-father account relations</u>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"6a357167cd03">
<p local-id=3D"39a8c7a71722"><u>Account - Contact role assignment</u>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3ae1716706c2">
<li local-id=3D"ae58f3855da3">
<p local-id=3D"46f8e76e8cf5">Enter the <strong>Account</strong> =E2=80=9C<e=
m>Playwright Test Reserved</em>=E2=80=9D and remove the <strong>contact rol=
e</strong> =E2=80=9C<em>Carrier Relations</em>=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"a02ba7d0badd">
<p local-id=3D"212d12972296"><u>Account - Account Extension view fields</u>=
:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"bc4bcf653ac3">
<li local-id=3D"0eb0c9c9281f">
<p local-id=3D"b628920ea7c5">Remove the <strong>Account</strong> =E2=80=9C<=
em>Account Extension View Test</em>=E2=80=9D</p>
</li>
